  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2011 SCBC Bishops Plenary</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sudan Catholic Bishops Conference hold annual or bi-annual Plenary Assemblies. The 2011 Plenary discuss the consequences for the Church of South Sudan&apos;s secession from 9th July 2011. CAFOD has been requested to support the cost of flights for participating Bishops. The events should provide clarity on the future structure of the Bishops Conference, including the national Caritas (Sudanaid) and Justice and Peace Commission.</narrative>
  </description>
